Package: TSGenerator
Title: Tools for Copernicus HR-VPP Vegetation Time-Series Processing
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Alexey", "Valero", , "avalero@cita-aragon.es", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5993-7346"))
Description: Tools for extracting, assessing, and analysing vegetation time series derived from Copernicus High Resolution Vegetation Phenology and Productivity (HR-VPP) products. The 2.0 development series focuses on currently supported Seasonal Trajectories (ST) and Vegetation Phenology and Productivity (VPP) products while retaining selected 1.x functions for legacy compatibility.
